      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nI'll remove the marks from your mini-map.\nIs there anything else I can do for you?",
      "translation" : "[毁葛向导婆婆]\n我会移除您小地图上的标记。\n还有什么我可以帮您的吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nHo ho ho ~!\nGuiding is very interesting.",
      "translation" : "[毁葛向导婆婆]\n呵呵呵~！\n做向导真是件有趣的事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Guide Rich King",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Rich King]\nWhat business do you have\nin this countryside village?",
      "translation" : "[富有的国王]\n你来这个乡间小村\n有什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Guide Rich King",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Rich King]\nThis is ^8B4513Hugel^000000\nin the Schwarzwald Republic.\nYou are very honored to receive guidance from a great person like me.",
      "translation" : "[富有的国王]\n这里是修瓦鲁兹巴鲁德共和国的^8B4513毁葛^000000。\n能得到像我这样伟大人物的指引，真是你的荣幸。"
